CONFIG PERMISSIONS - ThinkPad Yoga 11e (Arch Linux + i3)
Written 2026-11-07

Modes are octal, then symbolic. "Owner" is user:group.
Files marked (link) are stowed symlinks; chmod follows the link and changes
the real file inside ~/Gezaji/Configs, which is what git records.


